hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"254","On the authority of Muhammad bin Bashar Bandar, on the authority of Abdul Rahman, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Al-Aghar bin Al-Sabbah, on the authority of Khalifa bin Al-Husayn, on the authority of Qais bin Asim, He converted to Islam, so the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, ordered him to wash himself with water and lotus leaves."
"255","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, Yahya told us, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Al-Aghar, on the authority of Khalifa bin Al-Husayn, on the authority of Qais bin Asim, that He came to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and he released him and he converted to Islam. He ordered him to wash himself with water and lotus leaves."
